  "body_text": "感谢所有人的支持与付出，才有一年比一年好的产品！\n基本信息\n庄园（处理站）： 宏丰果给\n地区：普洱澜沧县拉巴乡塔拉弄村\n行政：普洱市\n位置：Lat 22.538428, Lng 99.614554\n海拔：1120-1400米\n品种：卡蒂姆 P3/P4\n处理方式：有容乃大定制超级日晒，蜜处理，岩茶处理\n风味：番石榴，柑橘，朗姆酒香，果汁感 （超级日晒）\nGuava, Citrus, Rum, Juicy\n柑橘，红糖，红茶 （蜜处理）\nCitrus, Brown sugar, Black tea\n热带水果，红茶，非常圆润 (岩茶）\nTropical fruits, Black tea, Round\n公司简介\n澜沧宏丰粮油贸易有限责任公司成立于2003年，是一家由自然人投资控股的企业，公司注册资本为50万元，主营有咖啡种植，加工，储存和销售。公司基地位于\n澜沧县城西部的拉巴乡塔拉弄村果给村民小组\n，现有咖啡种植面积1180亩，有自然村民141戶，近500余人口，农户有瓦族和拉祜族，现公司己建成咖啡晒厂面积8000多平米，加工厂房和仓库等350平方米，精品咖啡晒库250平方米。共计投入资金280万余元，现公司将以咖啡种植和以加工精品咖啡豆为主，精品咖啡有精品水洗豆，精品日晒豆，精品密处理豆和岩茶日晒豆等。基地所在地属亚热带温湿气候，海拨在1120至1300米之间。一年四季分明，雨量充沛光充足，早晚温差大，周边森林\n覆盖\n率达80%以上，周边无任何环境污染源，真可谓绿水青山，天然氧吧。\n产季结束后打扫整洁后的处理站\n处理过程简介\n鲜果采收\n浮选\n晾晒收干表皮水份（1天）\n收到塑胶桶中，开始厌氧发酵\n装桶\n滴答滴答滴答滴答...\n滴答滴答滴答滴答...\n...\n...\n发酵时间，根据产品定位和环境温度条件，与PH值的监控\n取出后，地面晾晒\n出桶时的pH\n晾晒\n出袋时的果子状态，与发酵液\n发酵液（闻起来酸酸的泡菜味）\n期待下一年的更好！\n公众号文章板块可查阅更多产区和豆子的信息\n选购咖啡请上淘宝，有赞",
  "body_html": "<p style=\"white-space: normal; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RBtkuJicibib5WMurAOEr6pElca5p1icBQZy87qhhJ96G9w0diccUU8LeCQ20FFvWz87gOwP5G8B7c8zg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n   感谢所有人的支持与付出，才有一年比一年好的产品！\n  </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n   基本信息\n  </strong>\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; border-style: solid; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098); transform-origin: 0px 0px; transform: scale(1, 0.5); visibility: visible;\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  庄园（处理站）： 宏丰果给\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  地区：普洱澜沧县拉巴乡塔拉弄村\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  行政：普洱市\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  位置：Lat 22.538428, Lng 99.614554\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  海拔：1120-1400米\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  品种：卡蒂姆 P3/P4\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方式：有容乃大定制超级日晒，蜜处理，岩茶处理\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：番石榴，柑橘，朗姆酒香，果汁感 （超级日晒）\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Guava, Citrus, Rum, Juicy\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  柑橘，红糖，红茶 （蜜处理）\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Citrus, Brown sugar, Black tea\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  热带水果，红茶，非常圆润 (岩茶）\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Tropical fruits, Black tea, Round\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RBtkuJicibib5WMurAOEr6pElcoicJFokGs7ib7peKWjicxaWoe2EynrhXAeyW7zmuP5S5pTP2g5tTRgQA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n   公司简介\n  </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; border-style: solid; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098); transform-origin: 0px 0px; transform: scale(1, 0.5); visibility: visible;\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73); color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n   澜沧宏丰粮油贸易有限责任公司成立于2003年，是一家由自然人投资控股的企业，公司注册资本为50万元，主营有咖啡种植，加工，储存和销售。公司基地位于\n   <strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n    澜沧县城西部的拉巴乡塔拉弄村果给村民小组\n   </strong>\n   ，现有咖啡种植面积1180亩，有自然村民141戶，近500余人口，农户有瓦族和拉祜族，现公司己建成咖啡晒厂面积8000多平米，加工厂房和仓库等350平方米，精品咖啡晒库250平方米。共计投入资金280万余元，现公司将以咖啡种植和以加工精品咖啡豆为主，精品咖啡有精品水洗豆，精品日晒豆，精品密处理豆和岩茶日晒豆等。基地所在地属亚热带温湿气候，海拨在1120至1300米之间。一年四季分明，雨量充沛光充足，早晚温差大，周边森林\n  </span>\n<span style=\"text-align: start;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, PingFangSC, AppleColorEmoji, Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, HiraginoSansGB, MicrosoftYaHei, 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">\n   覆盖\n  </span>\n<span style='text-align: start;caret-color: rgb(73, 73, 73);color: rgb(73, 73, 73);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Apple Color Emoji\", Helvetica, Tahoma, Arial, \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n   率达80%以上，周边无任何环境污染源，真可谓绿水青山，天然氧吧。\n  </span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RBtkuJicibib5WMurAOEr6pElOTqJFg5Xv51EDRbvSmNB1hcq4aEydCjjdPgYVl6ZOTXePtcQMGRyVA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  产季结束后打扫整洁后的处理站\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n   处理过程简介\n  </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  鲜果采收\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  浮选\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  晾晒收干表皮水份（1天）\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  收到塑胶桶中，开始厌氧发酵\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amleK7NJs2xT7vQRvIia3HHMia1SLu1E2eh9uCHHX6XwvGJ0QDbX9xdbvf5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  装桶\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  滴答滴答滴答滴答...\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  滴答滴答滴答滴答...\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  ...\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  ...\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  发酵时间，根据产品定位和环境温度条件，与PH值的监控\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  取出后，地面晾晒\n </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amleANzLeWTcWFHxfVib87ZpDdfleeH37xmUJDn010LJ22cbeu3hPOUV2og/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  出桶时的pH\n </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amle8b7GeHy4EJyP7rPgAIDaDYzmiaLWbUGjkRJLdR3z630arKdmpsXFZNQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: